      "author": "Avid Technology, Inc., OMF Developers Desk",
      "pages": "Printed95–96 and206; PDF indices106–107 and217",
      "role": "Original OMF2.1 source/timecode mapping and typed Drop/FPS schema; third-party mirror of primary document."
    }
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No full native Duration-cell owner/default/error policy proved.",
    "General source/timecode range qualification not exhaustively executed on all2412rows.",
    "No actual damaged/conflicting/high-bit/OMF2Drop fixtures run; structural damage and unsupported layouts still need explicit coverage.",
    "Missing NDF and damaged blank are proposed Bella display policies, not discovered universal MC behavior.",
    "Audio own-edit-clock interpretation remains proposed in the separate audio review; do not mark it approved here."
  ],
